    "detailed_description": "That One Dungeon is a fast-paced, pressure-intensive, infinite dungeon crawler!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick Your Class</h2>Choose from three distinct characters: Ranger(hunter), Wizard(mage), or Rogue(ninja)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823130/extras/8fae59cace4ac5bf36feacb3b795e471.avif?t=1710261014\" width=96 height=96 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823130/extras/3c0e2d3466a72513a84b9d4dd1a7cf1d.avif?t=1710261014\" width=96 height=96 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823130/extras/77bbe68639bcbffe4e18ce604980f016.avif?t=1710261014\" width=96 height=96 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore The Dungeon</h2>Find hidden secrets about the dungeon to uncover a hidden story behind every wall<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823130/extras/97f00205caba85c8bdc6a74303d58520.avif?t=1710261014\" width=96 height=96 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823130/extras/b760815458b5ad1ff166322e09e107d9.avif?t=1710261014\" width=96 height=96 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat The Hordes</h2>Many monsters will come after you including slimes and bats.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823130/extras/97815901295566af483b9968ebccf060.avif?t=1710261014\" width=96 height=96 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823130/extras/7fd07f19d20b77aca04e72906b45b66b.avif?t=1710261014\" width=96 height=96 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823130/extras/61f45cd945d4bd29015e85ff5b52f474.avif?t=1710261014\" width=96 height=96 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Test Your Luck</h2>Survive the dungeon by grabbing food or dodging enemy attacks!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823130/extras/2d2e98f497c5428557c4f98e5ce20d1a.avif?t=1710261014\" width=96 height=96 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather Your Riches</h2>Collect treasures to gain the top score and try to beat it with every dungeon run!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823130/extras/a9881fa05809b2b58938ba8541333b0e.avif?t=1710261014\" width=96 height=96 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Risk Your Fate</h2>Traps will prevent you from accessing certain areas so tread lightly while fighting for your life!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823130/extras/9935130ec53dadfac7d0c6bbeb85590c.avif?t=1710261014\" width=96 height=96 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823130/extras/b6aabf92bf76836935d41781187ce96a.avif?t=1710261014\" width=96 height=96 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "That One Dungeon is a fast-paced, pressure-intensive, infinite dungeon crawler!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick Your Class</h2>Choose from three distinct characters: Ranger(hunter), Wizard(mage), or Rogue(ninja)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823130/extras/8fae59cace4ac5bf36feacb3b795e471.avif?t=1710261014\" width=96 height=96 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823130/extras/3c0e2d3466a72513a84b9d4dd1a7cf1d.avif?t=1710261014\" width=96 height=96 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823130/extras/77bbe68639bcbffe4e18ce604980f016.avif?t=1710261014\" width=96 height=96 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore The Dungeon</h2>Find hidden secrets about the dungeon to uncover a hidden story behind every wall<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823130/extras/97f00205caba85c8bdc6a74303d58520.avif?t=1710261014\" width=96 height=96 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823130/extras/b760815458b5ad1ff166322e09e107d9.avif?t=1710261014\" width=96 height=96 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat The Hordes</h2>Many monsters will come after you including slimes and bats.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823130/extras/97815901295566af483b9968ebccf060.avif?t=1710261014\" width=96 height=96 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823130/extras/7fd07f19d20b77aca04e72906b45b66b.avif?t=1710261014\" width=96 height=96 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823130/extras/61f45cd945d4bd29015e85ff5b52f474.avif?t=1710261014\" width=96 height=96 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Test Your Luck</h2>Survive the dungeon by grabbing food or dodging enemy attacks!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823130/extras/2d2e98f497c5428557c4f98e5ce20d1a.avif?t=1710261014\" width=96 height=96 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather Your Riches</h2>Collect treasures to gain the top score and try to beat it with every dungeon run!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823130/extras/a9881fa05809b2b58938ba8541333b0e.avif?t=1710261014\" width=96 height=96 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Risk Your Fate</h2>Traps will prevent you from accessing certain areas so tread lightly while fighting for your life!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823130/extras/9935130ec53dadfac7d0c6bbeb85590c.avif?t=1710261014\" width=96 height=96 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823130/extras/b6aabf92bf76836935d41781187ce96a.avif?t=1710261014\" width=96 height=96 /></span>",
